(16,'dlbulova','Bulova, David','David L. Bulova',NULL,NULL,'male','David L. Bulova represents Virginia House District 11 as a Democrat, and took office in January 2006. A native of Fairfax, Bulova works as an environmental planner specializing in stormwater and Chesapeake Bay restoration. He chairs the House General Laws Committee and serves on the Appropriations and Agriculture, Chesapeake, and Natural Resources committees. He resides in Fairfax with his wife, Gretchen.','2006-11-19 15:09:59','2026-02-12 02:30:07'),
