(28,'apebbin','Ebbin, Adam','Adam P. Ebbin',NULL,'white','male','Adam P. Ebbin represents Virginia Senate District 39 as a Democrat, and took office in January 2012. Born in Huntington, New York, in 1963, Ebbin graduated from American University in 1985 with a Bachelor of Arts in Public Communication and Political Science. He works as a consultant and served in the Virginia House of Delegates from 2004 to 2012 before his election to the Senate. He resides in Alexandria.','2006-11-19 15:09:59','2026-01-06 02:11:30'),
