(315,'gmloupassi','Loupassi, Manoli','G. Manoli Loupassi','1967-06-08','white','male','<a href=\"http://www.loupassilaw.com/\">Practicing attorney</a> specializing in criminal, traffic and DUI defense. Holds degrees from Washington and Lee and the T.C. Williams School of Law. The child of a Cretan immigrant and a former restauranteur. Former president of the Richmond City Council. Married with three children.','2007-11-17 18:39:29','2020-02-15 02:19:18'),
(316,'jpmassie','Massie, Jimmie','James P. Massie III','1958-05-03','white','male','Private equity investor. Graduate of the University of Virginia. Married with four children.','2007-11-21 19:33:41','2020-02-15 02:19:18'),
