(374,'bereeves','Reeves, Bryce','Bryce E. Reeves',NULL,'white','male','Bryce E. Reeves represents Virginia Senate District 28 as a Republican, and took office in January 2012. Born in California in 1966, Reeves earned a Bachelor of Science from Texas A&M University and a Master of Public Administration from George Mason University. He works as a provider of insurance and financial products. He resides in Spotsylvania County.','2011-12-29 22:59:09','2026-01-06 02:11:30'),
