(396,'rtbloxom','Bloxom, Rob','Robert T. Bloxom, Jr.','1963-02-12',NULL,'male','Robert T. Bloxom represents Virginia House District 100 as a Republican, and took office in February 2014. Bloxom graduated from Broadwater Academy in 1981 and works in sales and aquaculture. He resides in Accomack County.','2015-01-18 13:00:00','2026-02-12 02:30:07'),
