(418,'mjpeake','Peake, Mark','Mark J. Peake',NULL,'white','male','Mark J. Peake represents Virginia Senate District 8 as a Republican, and took office in January 2017. Born in Greensboro, North Carolina, in 1963 and raised in Roanoke, Peake earned a Bachelor of Arts from Virginia Tech and a Juris Doctor from Washington & Lee University School of Law. He practices as an attorney and resides in Lynchburg with his wife, Lila.','2017-01-14 00:00:00','2026-01-06 02:11:30'),
