(561,'jlpence','Pence, Justin','Justin Lane Pence',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Justin L. Pence represents Virginia House District 33 as a Republican, and took office in January 2026. Pence earned a Bachelor\'s Degree in Animal and Poultry Science with a minor in Economics from Virginia Tech. He is self-employed and resides in Shenandoah County.','2025-12-06 17:42:28','2026-02-04 17:42:53'),
