(564,'mjrwhittle','Whittle, Madison','Madison John Redd Whittle',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Madison J.R. Whittle represents Virginia House District 14 as a Republican, and took office in January 2026. Whittle graduated from George Washington High School in Danville and serves as President and CEO of MJRW, Inc. She resides in Pittsylvania County.','2025-12-06 17:42:33','2026-02-05 17:42:17'),
