(8,'Kenneth C. Alexander','Alexander, Kenneth','Sen. Kenneth Alexander (D-Norfolk)','kcalexander','alexander','senate',245,'2012-09-04','2017-01-10','D',NULL,'1966-10-17','black','male','Alexander holds degrees from Old Dominion University and Norwich University. He is the owner of a funeral home. Alexander served in the House of Delegates from 2002–2012.','','804-698-1089','120 West Berkeley Avenue, Norfolk, VA 23523',NULL,'district05@senate.virginia.gov','http://senatorkennethcalexander.com/','http://senatorkennethcalexander.com/feed',NULL,'CC-12-01264','89','Norfolk','O:8:\"stdClass\":1:{s:4:\"List\";N;}',44,'2020-02-15 02:19:18','2006-11-19 15:09:59'),
(9,'Kristen J. Amundson','Amundson, Kris','Del. Kris Amundson (D-Mount Vernon)','kjamundson','amundson','house',44,'2000-01-01','2010-01-13','D','Served as the Chairman of the Democratic House Campaign Committee. Education writer and consultant. Born in Brainerd, MN. Before being elected as a member of the General Assembly, she served for nearly a decade on the Fairfax County School Board, including two years as its chairman. She received a BA from Macalester College and an MA from the American University. The mother of one adult daughter.','1949-12-03','white','female',NULL,'','804-698-1044','P. O. Box 143, Mount Vernon, VA 22121',NULL,'delkamundson@house.virginia.gov','http://www.amundson.org/','http://amundson.org/?feed=rss2',NULL,NULL,'126','Mount Vernon',NULL,24,'2020-02-15 02:19:18','2006-11-19 15:09:59'),
(10,'Ward L. Armstrong','Armstrong, Ward','Del. Ward Armstrong (D-Martinsville)','wlarmstrong','armstrong','house',10,'1992-01-01','2012-01-10','D',NULL,NULL,'white','male',NULL,'','804-698-1010','P.O. Box 1431, Martinsville, VA 24114',NULL,'DelWArmstrong@house.virginia.gov','http://www.wardarmstrong.com/',NULL,NULL,NULL,'4','Martinsville',NULL,43,'2020-02-15 02:19:18','2006-11-19 15:09:59'),
