(308,'Jill Holtzman Vogel','Vogel, Jill Holtzman','Sen. Jill Holtzman Vogel (R-Winchester)','jhvogel','vogel','senate',267,'2008-01-09','2024-01-10','R','Shenandoah Valley native. Practicing campaign finance attorney. One of the team of attorneys who represented the Bush-Cheney campaign in the Florida recount in 2000. Former Chief Counsel of the Republican National Committee. Received her BA in government and religion from William and Mary and her JD from DePaul University. Married with four children.',NULL,'white','female',NULL,'540-662-4551','804-698-7527','117 East Picadilly Street, Suite 100-B, Winchester VA 22601',NULL,'district27@senate.virginia.gov','http://www.votejill.com/',NULL,'JillHVogel','CC-12-00051','79','Winchester','O:8:\"stdClass\":1:{s:4:\"List\";N;}',58,'2023-12-30 01:53:21','2007-11-17 16:16:12'),
