(319,'Joseph D. Morrissey','Morrissey, Joe','Sen. Joe Morrissey (D-Richmond)','jdmorrissey','morrissey','senate',256,'2020-01-08','2024-01-10','D','Delegate Morrissey served as Richmond commonwealth\'s attorney from 1989-1993. He holds a BA in economics from the University of Virginia, a JD from Georgetown and an Master of Laws from Trinity College (Dublin). He has three children. A Democrat, in 2014 he was convicted of contributing to the delinquency of a minor, leading him to resign his seat, run for reelection as an independent, and win his seat again.','1957-09-23','white','male',NULL,'804-737-1626','804-698-7516','701 German School Road\r\nRichmond, VA 23225 ',NULL,'district16@senate.virginia.gov',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'110','Highland Springs',NULL,29,'2023-12-30 01:53:21','2007-11-21 19:52:41'),
(320,'Brenda L. Pogge','Pogge, Brenda','Del. Brenda Pogge (R-Williamsburg)','blpogge','pogge','house',236,'2008-01-09','2020-01-07','R','Real estate agent. Married with five children.','1957-03-18','white','female',NULL,'757-223-9690','804-698-1096','8412 Down Patrick Highway, Williamsburg, VA 23188',NULL,'DelBPogge@house.virginia.gov','http://www.brendapogge.com/',NULL,'brendapogge','CC-12-00172','203','Williamsburg','O:8:\"stdClass\":1:{s:4:\"List\";N;}',72,'2020-02-15 02:19:18','2007-11-21 20:08:44'),
(321,'Charles D. Poindexter','Poindexter, Charles','Del. Charles Poindexter (R-Glade Hill)','cdpoindexter','poindexter','house',149,'2008-01-09','2022-01-11','R',NULL,'1942-02-27','white','male','Retired from the military software development field. Served on the Franklin County board of supervisors for eight years immediately prior to election to this office. Holds a BS in mathematics from Lynchburg College and a MS in management from George Washington University. A Franklin County native. Married with six grown children and ten grandchildren. ','540-576-2600','804-698-1009','PO Box 117, Glade Hill VA 24092',NULL,'DelCPoindexter@house.virginia.gov',NULL,NULL,'Del_CPoindexter','CC-12-01049','204','Glade Hill','O:8:\"stdClass\":1:{s:4:\"List\";N;}',81,'2021-12-06 02:08:22','2007-11-21 20:14:52'),
(322,'John C. Miller','Miller, John','Sen. John Miller (D-Newport News)','jcmiller','miller, j.c.','senate',241,'2008-01-09','2016-04-04','D','Vice President of University Relations at Christopher Newport. Prior to that he was a news anchor at WVEC for six years, news director of the same station for twelve years, and administrative assistant to U.S. Sen. Paul Trible for six years.  Got his BS and ED from Northern Illinois University. Married with two grown children.','1947-12-09','white','male',NULL,'757-595-1100',NULL,'12284 Warwick Blvd., Suite 2G, Newport News, VA 23606',NULL,'district01@senate.virginia.gov','http://www.senatorjohnmiller.com/',NULL,NULL,'CC-12-01153','74','Newport News','O:8:\"stdClass\":8:{s:9:\"AccountId\";s:36:\"6a1413c2-66cb-e111-b0b8-984be103f032\";s:13:\"CommitteeCode\";s:11:\"CC-12-01153\";s:13:\"CommitteeName\";s:22:\"Friends of John Miller\";s:13:\"CandidateName\";s:28:\"Senator John Clifford Miller\";s:13:\"CommitteeType\";s:28:\"Candidate Campaign Committee\";s:7:\"Reports\";O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:1:\"0\";O:8:\"stdClass\":10:{s:9:\"DateFiled\";s:10:\"2013-01-15\";s:13:\"Contributions\";s:10:\"$26,336.56\";s:13:\"EndingBalance\";s:10:\"$29,475.63\";s:3:\"Url\";s:52:\"http://cfreports.sbe.virginia.gov/Report/Index/13777\";s:2:\"Id\";s:5:\"13777\";s:11:\"PeriodStart\";s:10:\"2012-07-01\";s:9:\"PeriodEnd\";s:10:\"2012-12-31\";s:6:\"XmlUrl\";s:56:\"http://cfreports.sbe.virginia.gov/Report/ReportXML/13777\";s:6:\"PdfUrl\";s:56:\"http://cfreports.sbe.virginia.gov/Report/ReportPDF/13777\";s:7:\"api_url\";s:53:\"http://openva.com/campaign-finance/reports/13777.json\";}s:1:\"1\";O:8:\"stdClass\":10:{s:9:\"DateFiled\";s:10:\"2012-07-16\";s:13:\"Contributions\";s:10:\"$16,800.00\";s:13:\"EndingBalance\";s:10:\"$16,988.79\";s:3:\"Url\";s:51:\"http://cfreports.sbe.virginia.gov/Report/Index/6360\";s:2:\"Id\";s:4:\"6360\";s:11:\"PeriodStart\";s:10:\"2012-01-01\";s:9:\"PeriodEnd\";s:10:\"2012-06-30\";s:6:\"XmlUrl\";s:55:\"http://cfreports.sbe.virginia.